/************************************************************
 * Code.gs — PERFORMANCE OPTIMIZED VERSION (Updated)
 *
 * PDF GENERATION RULES (do NOT change):
 *  1) submitFormAndCreatePDF  -> Builds the PDF ONLY from the current
 *                                submission. Nothing is read from INWARD.
 *  2) createChallanPDF        -> Builds the PDF from INWARD, using ALL
 *                                rows of that dispatchId. Full reprint.
 *
 * NEW IN THIS UPDATE:
 *  - Transport Name is NOT printed on the PDF (but it is still saved to
 *    INWARD column 21 — the save/store logic stays intact).
 *  - PCS Per Bora / PCS Per Bale are read from the Master sheet and an
 *    "Avg/pc" (average weight per piece) is shown on the weight side of
 *    each item block. Bora type -> PCS Per Bora, Bale type -> PCS Per Bale.
 *    (Box has no PCS column in Master, so Avg/pc is skipped for Box.)
 *  - PDF layout: Dispatch/Contractor on the LEFT (item side); Total Weight
 *    + Avg/pc + Count on the RIGHT (weight side).
 *  - Grand total: Bora, Bale and Box are counted separately.
 *  - searchChallanIds() powers the reprint search.
 *
 * All original logic (cache, lock, batch writes, duplicate prevention)
 * is 100% preserved.
 ************************************************************/

